        "root_concepts": "[bleu, nmt]",
        "section": "translation",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Neural MT Evaluation and What BLEU Misses",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "STEP 1: N-GRAM PRECISION (for n = 1, 2, 3, 4)\n  Count how many n-grams in the candidate appear in\n  any reference translation.\n  Clip count: an n-gram can only match as many times\n  as it appears in the reference."
    },
    {
      "id": "09-BLEU-NMT.md#013",
      "path": [
        "09-BLEU-NMT.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:translation:09-bleu-nmt, git-history:translation:09-bleu-nmt]",
        "canonical_path": "translation/09-BLEU-NMT.md",
        "concepts": "[bleu, nmt]",
        "current_path": "translation/09-BLEU-NMT.md",
        "id": "maxim:translation:bleu-nmt",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "translation",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[bleu, nmt]",
        "section": "translation",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Neural MT Evaluation and What BLEU Misses",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "EXAMPLE:\n  Candidate: \"the cat the cat sat on the mat\"\n  Reference: \"the cat sat on the mat\"\n  1-gram \"the\" appears 3 times in candidate;\n  only 2 times in reference → clipped count = 2.\n  Without clipping: naive system could repeat \"the\"\n  indefinitely and get high 1-gram precision."
    },
    {
      "id": "09-BLEU-NMT.md#014",
      "path": [
        "09-BLEU-NMT.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:translation:09-bleu-nmt, git-history:translation:09-bleu-nmt]",
