        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Neural MT Evaluation and What BLEU Misses",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "BP = 1 if c > r\n  BP = e^(1 - r/c) if c ≤ r\n  (c = candidate length, r = reference length)"
    },
    {
      "id": "09-BLEU-NMT.md#016",
      "path": [
        "09-BLEU-NMT.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
