        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Neural MT Evaluation and What BLEU Misses",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "STEP 3: GEOMETRIC MEAN OF N-GRAM PRECISIONS\n  BLEU = BP × exp(Σ wₙ × log pₙ)\n  where wₙ = 1/4 (equal weights for n=1,2,3,4)\n  and pₙ is the modified n-gram precision for order n"
    },
