        "title": "Neural MT Evaluation and What BLEU Misses",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "BLEU has been extensively critiqued since its introduction. The critique is not that it's useless — it correlates reasonably well with human judgment for ranking systems — but that it fails in systematic and important ways:"
    },
    {
      "id": "09-BLEU-NMT.md#021",
      "path": [
        "09-BLEU-NMT.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:translation:09-bleu-nmt, git-history:translation:09-bleu-nmt]",
        "canonical_path": "translation/09-BLEU-NMT.md",
        "concepts": "[bleu, nmt]",
        "current_path": "translation/09-BLEU-NMT.md",
        "id": "maxim:translation:bleu-nmt",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
