        "root_concepts": "[bleu, nmt]",
        "section": "translation",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Neural MT Evaluation and What BLEU Misses",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\nBLEU FAILURE MODES\n════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════"
    },
    {
      "id": "09-BLEU-NMT.md#022",
      "path": [
        "09-BLEU-NMT.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:translation:09-bleu-nmt, git-history:translation:09-bleu-nmt]",
        "canonical_path": "translation/09-BLEU-NMT.md",
        "concepts": "[bleu, nmt]",
        "current_path": "translation/09-BLEU-NMT.md",
        "id": "maxim:translation:bleu-nmt",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "translation",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[bleu, nmt]",
        "section": "translation",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Neural MT Evaluation and What BLEU Misses",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "1. DOES NOT CAPTURE FLUENCY\n  Candidate: \"sat cat the mat the on the\"\n  Reference: \"the cat sat on the mat\"\n  BLEU score: high (all unigrams match, several bigrams)\n  Human judgment: completely unintelligible"
    },
    {
      "id": "09-BLEU-NMT.md#023",
      "path": [
        "09-BLEU-NMT.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:translation:09-bleu-nmt, git-history:translation:09-bleu-nmt]",
        "canonical_path": "translation/09-BLEU-NMT.md",
        "concepts": "[bleu, nmt]",
        "current_path": "translation/09-BLEU-NMT.md",
        "id": "maxim:translation:bleu-nmt",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "translation",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[bleu, nmt]",
        "section": "translation",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Neural MT Evaluation and What BLEU Misses",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "2. ONE CORRECT TRANSLATION PENALIZES OTHERS\n  Reference: \"the cat sat on the mat\"\n  Candidate: \"the cat was sitting on the mat\"\n  BLEU: lower than reference match\n  Human judgment: acceptable paraphrase\n  The problem: BLEU doesn't know about paraphrase"
    },
    {
      "id": "09-BLEU-NMT.md#024",
      "path": [
        "09-BLEU-NMT.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:translation:09-bleu-nmt, git-history:translation:09-bleu-nmt]",
        "canonical_path": "translation/09-BLEU-NMT.md",
        "concepts": "[bleu, nmt]",
        "current_path": "translation/09-BLEU-NMT.md",
        "id": "maxim:translation:bleu-nmt",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "translation",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[bleu, nmt]",
        "section": "translation",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Neural MT Evaluation and What BLEU Misses",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "3. IGNORES PRAGMATICS AND REGISTER\n  Source (formal): \"Veuillez agréer l'expression de mes sentiments distingués\"\n  Reference: \"Yours sincerely,\"\n  Candidate (literal): \"Please accept the expression of my distinguished sentiments\"\n  BLEU: candidate scores low (different from reference)\n  Human judgment: candidate is technically accurate but pragmatically wrong —\n  no one ends an English business letter that way.\n  BLEU cannot detect pragmatic failure."
    },
    {
      "id": "09-BLEU-NMT.md#025",
      "path": [
        "09-BLEU-NMT.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:translation:09-bleu-nmt, git-history:translation:09-bleu-nmt]",
        "canonical_path": "translation/09-BLEU-NMT.md",
        "concepts": "[bleu, nmt]",
        "current_path": "translation/09-BLEU-NMT.md",
        "id": "maxim:translation:bleu-nmt",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "translation",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[bleu, nmt]",
        "section": "translation",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Neural MT Evaluation and What BLEU Misses",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "4. IGNORES CULTURAL ADEQUACY\n  Source mentions \"a rice cooker\" (culturally familiar in Japan)\n  Reference: \"a rice cooker\"\n  Candidate: \"a special pot\" (culturally adapted)\n  BLEU: candidate scores low\n  Human judgment: may depend on audience —\n  for a Japanese-culture text for a Japanese audience, wrong;\n  for explaining the concept to Western readers, possibly right."
    },
    {
      "id": "09-BLEU-NMT.md#026",
      "path": [
        "09-BLEU-NMT.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:translation:09-bleu-nmt, git-history:translation:09-bleu-nmt]",
        "canonical_path": "translation/09-BLEU-NMT.md",
        "concepts": "[bleu, nmt]",
        "current_path": "translation/09-BLEU-NMT.md",
        "id": "maxim:translation:bleu-nmt",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "translation",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[bleu, nmt]",
        "section": "translation",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Neural MT Evaluation and What BLEU Misses",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "5. IGNORES HALLUCINATION\n  Source: \"The meeting was on Tuesday.\"\n  Candidate: \"The meeting was on Tuesday, and the chairman resigned.\"\n  BLEU: candidate may score normally or low (depending on reference)\n  Human judgment: the added information is fabricated —\n  critical error in any high-stakes domain.\n  BLEU has no mechanism to detect additions that weren't in the source."
    },
    {
      "id": "09-BLEU-NMT.md#027",
      "path": [
        "09-BLEU-NMT.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:translation:09-bleu-nmt, git-history:translation:09-bleu-nmt]",
        "canonical_path": "translation/09-BLEU-NMT.md",
        "concepts": "[bleu, nmt]",
        "current_path": "translation/09-BLEU-NMT.md",
        "id": "maxim:translation:bleu-nmt",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "translation",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[bleu, nmt]",
        "section": "translation",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Neural MT Evaluation and What BLEU Misses",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "6. GENDER BIAS\n  Source (generic masculine in Spanish): \"El médico llegó tarde\"\n  Reference (English): \"The doctor arrived late\"\n  Candidate (gendered): \"He arrived late\" (male default)\n  BLEU: may score fine against \"The doctor arrived late\"\n  Feminist MT critique: NMT systematically defaults to male\n  for professional roles, female for service roles.\n  BLEU is blind to this.\n```"
    },
