        "root_concepts": "[bleu, nmt]",
        "section": "translation",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Neural MT Evaluation and What BLEU Misses",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\nMT EVALUATION METRICS — COMPARISON\n════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════"
    },
    {
      "id": "09-BLEU-NMT.md#031",
      "path": [
        "09-BLEU-NMT.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:translation:09-bleu-nmt, git-history:translation:09-bleu-nmt]",
        "canonical_path": "translation/09-BLEU-NMT.md",
        "concepts": "[bleu, nmt]",
        "current_path": "translation/09-BLEU-NMT.md",
        "id": "maxim:translation:bleu-nmt",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "translation",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[bleu, nmt]",
        "section": "translation",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Neural MT Evaluation and What BLEU Misses",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "METEOR (Banerjee & Lavie, 2005):\n  ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n  │ Adds to BLEU: synonym matching, stemming, recall         │\n  │ Correlates better with human judgment than BLEU          │\n  │ More computationally expensive                           │\n  │ Language-specific modules (worse for low-resource)       │\n  └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘"
    },
    {
      "id": "09-BLEU-NMT.md#032",
      "path": [
        "09-BLEU-NMT.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:translation:09-bleu-nmt, git-history:translation:09-bleu-nmt]",
        "canonical_path": "translation/09-BLEU-NMT.md",
        "concepts": "[bleu, nmt]",
        "current_path": "translation/09-BLEU-NMT.md",
        "id": "maxim:translation:bleu-nmt",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "translation",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[bleu, nmt]",
        "section": "translation",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Neural MT Evaluation and What BLEU Misses",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "TER (Translation Error Rate):\n  ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n  │ Edit distance: how many edits needed to go from          │\n  │ candidate to reference?                                  │\n  │ Allows reordering (with additional cost)                 │\n  │ Lower = better; 0 = perfect match; >1 = very bad         │\n  │ Good for post-editing time estimation                    │\n  └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘"
    },
    {
      "id": "09-BLEU-NMT.md#033",
      "path": [
        "09-BLEU-NMT.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:translation:09-bleu-nmt, git-history:translation:09-bleu-nmt]",
        "canonical_path": "translation/09-BLEU-NMT.md",
        "concepts": "[bleu, nmt]",
        "current_path": "translation/09-BLEU-NMT.md",
        "id": "maxim:translation:bleu-nmt",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "translation",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[bleu, nmt]",
        "section": "translation",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Neural MT Evaluation and What BLEU Misses",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "chrF (Popovic, 2015):\n  ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n  │ Character n-gram F-score                                 │\n  │ Better for morphologically rich languages                │\n  │ (Turkish, Finnish, Czech)                                │\n  │ No tokenization required — language-neutral              │\n  │ Correlates well with human for many languages            │\n  └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘"
    },
    {
      "id": "09-BLEU-NMT.md#034",
      "path": [
        "09-BLEU-NMT.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:translation:09-bleu-nmt, git-history:translation:09-bleu-nmt]",
        "canonical_path": "translation/09-BLEU-NMT.md",
        "concepts": "[bleu, nmt]",
        "current_path": "translation/09-BLEU-NMT.md",
        "id": "maxim:translation:bleu-nmt",
        "index_roles": "[guide, root-concept]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "translation",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[bleu, nmt]",
        "section": "translation",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Neural MT Evaluation and What BLEU Misses",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "BERTScore (Zhang et al., 2019):\n  ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n  │ Compare candidate and reference using BERT contextual    │\n  │ embeddings rather than surface n-gram overlap            │\n  │ Captures semantic similarity even when paraphrased       │\n  │ \"cat sat on mat\" ≈ \"feline rested on carpet\" (higher     │\n  │ score than BLEU would give)                              │\n  │ Requires BERT model; computationally heavier             │\n  │ Still doesn't capture pragmatics, hallucination          │\n  └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘"
    },
    {
